along just fine in the all-purpose Driven Backpack. Crafted with tough polyester ripstop fabric, it's outfitted with rubberized end panels and padded, adjustable shoulder straps. The roomy main compartment features molded foam pockets that host everything you need.<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Large main and small zip compartments.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Adjustable, padded straps.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Interior foam pockets.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Exterior zip compartment.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Left sport bottle pocket.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Survival gear sold separately.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\",\"price\":{\"value\":36,\"discountedValue\":36},\"slug\":\"driven-backpack-208\",\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"201\",\"name\":\"Gear\",\"slug\":\"gear\",\"label\":\"Gear\",\"parent\":{\"id\":\"181\",\"name\":\"Lumax\",\"slug\":\"lumax\",\"label\":\"Lumax\",\"parent\":{\"id\":\"1\",\"name\":\"Root Catalog\",\"slug\":\"root-catalog-1\",\"label\":\"Root Catalog\"}}},{\"id\":\"202\",\"name\":\"Bags\",\"slug\":\"bags\",\"label\":\"Bags\",\"parent\":{\"id\":\"201\",\"name\":\"Gear\",\"slug\":\"gear\",\"label\":\"Gear\",\"parent\":{\"id\":\"181\",\"name\":\"Lumax\",\"slug\":\"lumax\",\"label\":\"Lumax\",\"parent\":{\"id\":\"1\",\"name\":\"Root Catalog\",\"slug\":\"root-catalog-1\",\"label\":\"Root Catalog\"}}}}],\"gallery\":[{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/master-7rqtwti-f3ef32mfqsxfe.us-4.magentosite.cloud\\/media\\/catalog\\/product\\/w\\/b\\/wb03-purple-0.jpg\",\"alt\":\"Image\"}],\"quantity\":100,\"variants\":[]}"}}}}{"key":"lumax_product:209","action":"publish","eventTime":{"long":1746197730382},"properties":{"sx:type":"product/simple"},"payload":{"dev.streamx.blueprints.data.Data":{"content":{"bytes":"{\"sku\":\"24-WB07\",\"id\":\"209\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"attributes\":[{\"name\":\"small_image\",\"label\":\"Small\",\"values\":[{\"value\":\"https:\\/\\/master-7rqtwti-f3ef32mfqsxfe.us-4.magentosite.cloud\\/media\\/catalog\\/product\\/w\\/b\\/wb07-brown-0.jpg\",\"label\":\"https:\\/\\/master-7rqtwti-f3ef32mfqsxfe.us-4.magentosite.